any disturbance.

1303
01:24:40.921 --> 01:24:42.453
No, no. It didn't disturb me.
It was...

1304
01:24:42.455 --> 01:24:43.857
That was unfortunate.

1305
01:24:48.962 --> 01:24:50.462
Well...

1306
01:24:50.464 --> 01:24:52.030
