I was wrong the whole time.

1374
01:28:15.639 --> 01:28:17.773
Ginny...

1375
01:28:17.775 --> 01:28:20.709
I'm sorry.
If I could drop everything

1376
01:28:20.711 --> 01:28:23.848
<i>and go do it, I would.
But I'm sorry...</i>

1377
