She's in her bedroom.

1380
01:29:05.324 --> 01:29:07.226
Okay. I'm gonna go in.

1381
01:29:19.138 --> 01:29:20.406
Hello, Mary.

1382
01:29:24.310 --> 01:29:25.745
Earl,

1383
01:29:26.546 --> 01:29:28.112
what do you want?

