to get back out there.

1400
01:30:27.274 --> 01:30:28.443
Yeah.

1401
01:30:29.510 --> 01:30:30.809
Well, you're right.

1402
01:30:30.811 --> 01:30:32.345
I thought it was
more important

1403
01:30:32.347 --> 01:30:35.350
