1404
01:30:37.017 --> 01:30:40.355
than the damn failure I was
here at my own home.

1405
01:30:45.792 --> 01:30:47.328
Anyway, for what it's worth,

1406
01:30:48.895 --> 01:30:50.465
I'm here now.

1407
01:30:53.434 --> 01:30:55.236
I don't know why,

1408
01:30:56.704 --> 01:30:58.473
