Mmm.

1424
01:32:32.802 --> 01:32:34.604
- You all right?
- Mmm-hmm.

1425
01:32:35.605 --> 01:32:38.041
Mmm. Good.

1426
01:32:40.778 --> 01:32:43.213
Earl.

1427
01:32:44.180 --> 01:32:46.582
Tell me something?

1428
01:32:46.584 --> 01:32:48.084
