1432
01:33:01.298 --> 01:33:03.532
I'm a high-end gigolo.

1433
01:33:07.772 --> 01:33:09.805
- Bounty hunter?
- Come on.

1434
01:33:09.807 --> 01:33:11.407
Seriously, come on.

1435
01:33:11.409 --> 01:33:13.308
- All right, seriously.
- Mmm-hmm.

1436
01:33:13.310 --> 01:33:16.645
I've become a drug mule
