1450
01:34:33.960 --> 01:34:36.494
I don't think so.

1451
01:34:36.496 --> 01:34:38.829
I think you're just
a late bloomer.

1452
01:34:40.867 --> 01:34:42.568
Yeah.

1453
01:34:47.607 --> 01:34:48.839
They're shitting bricks.

1454
01:34:48.841 --> 01:34:51.041
They haven't heard from him
