1471
01:35:34.988 --> 01:35:36.955
Okay, do it.

1472
01:35:36.957 --> 01:35:38.258
Thank you.

1473
01:36:14.929 --> 01:36:17.165
What? You okay?

1474
01:36:19.834 --> 01:36:21.536
It's all right.

1475
01:36:28.376 --> 01:36:33.412
You were the love of my life

1476
01:36:33.414 --> 01:36:36.718
